; ==============================================================================
; MARK: 7: 💬 ノアはいつ死んだ？
; ==============================================================================
; ＠ト書き▼議論シーン1-7 ノアはいつ死んだ？
; BGM変更：rAwTell Owk...
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_7_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

# Judge1-7-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:あてぃしたちは寝る前に<br>ノアの部屋の前を通ってるわけ。<br>そこに死体があったら、<br>気付かないわけないじゃん？|#0101Trial07_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:だからあの時さぁ、<br>ノアは<br>【生きてた】んじゃねーの？|#0101Trial07_Coco002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"<link=\"Objection_01_01_07_01\">絵でも描いてた</link>とかさ。<br>そういや<link=\"Objection_01_01_07_02\">足音も聞こえた</link><br>気がするし！<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_07_03\">ピンピンしてた</link>はずだって！|#0101Trial07_Coco003|" RevealSpeed:1

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そ、そうだったっけ……？<br>うーん……<br>言われてみれば、<br>そうかもしれないけど……。|#0101Trial07_Miria001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,44 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:だからノアが殺されたのは<br>その後！<br>【就寝時間から朝まで】の間<br>しかねーの！|#0101Trial07_Coco004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,Arms
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……しかし就寝時間は<br>鍵がかけられるはずだよ。<br>外に出る事ができても、<br>入る事は<br>できないんじゃないかな？|#0101Trial07_Leia001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:34,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:あら、<br>それなら就寝時間前に<br>ノアちゃんの部屋に<br>忍び込んでおけば<br>問題ないんじゃないかしら。|#0101Trial07_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:それだ！<br>そしてそれができるのは、<br>就寝時間にルームメイトと<br>一緒にいなかったヤツだけ……！|#0101Trial07_Coco005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:メルちゃんが<br>隣の部屋にいたのは<br>あてぃし見てるし……。|#0101Trial07_Coco006| RevealSpeed:1

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"つまりノアを殺せるのは<br>就寝時間に<link=\"Objection_01_01_07_04\">アリバイがない</link>……<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_07_05\">医務室のアンアン</link>か、<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_07_06\">１人部屋のエマっち</link>の<br>どっちかなんだよ！|#0101Trial07_Coco007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:37,52 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:違うってんなら……<br>証拠見せてよ、<br>証拠！！|#0101Trial07_Coco008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,50 Roll:-4

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:true ProcessTimer:true
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

